2. OpenSpec — CLI invocation sequences reproduced
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

craft calls the OpenSpec CLI directly and reproduces its documented command
sequences (`openspec new change`, `status --json`, `instructions <artifact>
--json`, `validate`, `archive`, and the `--store` resolution rule).

    Project:  OpenSpec (@fission-ai/openspec)
    Version:  CLI >= 1.6.0  (required — craft's copied sequences assume this
              command surface; a CLI downgrade breaks them silently)
    License:  MIT

No OpenSpec source code is vendored. craft does not invoke the openspec-*
skills that `openspec init` installs into a project's .claude/skills/; those
skills remain the property and responsibility of the OpenSpec project and are
recreated by `openspec update`.
